(2831, 'Youngstown-State-University-know-more', 'youngstownstateuniversityknowmore', 'Youngstown State University', NULL, 'Main', 'Normal', NULL, 1, 'Youngstown State University is a public institution that was founded in 1908. It has a total undergraduate enrollment of 10,468 (fall 2020), its setting is city, and the campus size is 160 acres. It utilizes a semester-based academic calendar. Youngstown State University\'s ranking in the 2022 edition of Best Colleges is Regional Universities Midwest, #119-#157.', NULL, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Bachelors&nbsp;Degree</strong><br />\r\nAvariety of Bachelor\'s degree programs in fields related to:&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Bachelor of Arts in Arts Management</strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Bachelor of Fine Arts in Theatre Management</strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Bachelor of Arts in Arts Administration</strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Bachelor of Arts in Arts and Cultural Management&nbsp;</strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Bachelor of Arts in Entertainment Management&nbsp;</strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Bachelor of Arts in Arts Management&nbsp;</strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Bachelor of Arts in Arts Management&nbsp;</strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Bachelor of Arts in Arts Administration&nbsp;</strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Bachelor of Fine Arts in Theatre Arts Management&nbsp;</strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Bachelor of Arts in Arts Management&nbsp;</strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Bachelor of Fine Arts in Theatre Management&nbsp;</strong></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Bachelor of Arts in Arts Administration&nbsp;